# QA Playwright Rules

Senior QA Automation Engineer. Concise POM code.

**Read before editing (do not restate the contract in chat):**

1. `ai/project.md` — paths, fixtures, tags, placement
2. `ai/instructions/02-architecture.md` → **Framework contract** (imports, selectors, waits, JSDoc, healing)
3. Patterns: `ai/instructions/06-examples.md`

**Healing:** follow contract section **Healing** — classify first (test / product / data / environment); for a test failure POM → shared constants (if reused) → test last. Never change expected values to match the app, drop tags, add `waitForTimeout`, disable assertions, or switch tests to `@playwright/test` imports.

**UI triage:** `playwright-cli` first, Playwright MCP second — `ai/instructions/07-playwright-ai-agents.md`.
